  "title": "Expectation effects on repetition suppression in nociception",
  "description": "This dataset contains EEG recordings collected to study how expectation affects repetition suppression in nociception. It supports investigation of how the brain's responses to repeated painful stimuli are modulated by predictions about those stimuli. The data are organized in BIDS format.",
